{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Ixw4eMAAYe1793621574.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>警方拘捕一名男子涉嫌狂亂駕駛，撞毀港珠澳大橋檢查亭。</p><p></p><p>網上片段見到，多輛警車嘗試阻截一名黑色私家車，有交通警企圖制止。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.ARREST 1900 new video_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wUi6TLY9GJ1793621598.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>另一條片段見到，大批警員在屯門海皇路拘捕一名男子，被捕男子的父親是私家車登記車主，到場協助警方調查。</p><p></p><p>據了解，疑犯昨日先在元朗八鄉發生碰撞後不顧而去。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.ARREST 1900 new video.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026IeIu3dqeTw1793621628.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>到凌晨一時許駕駛私家車在港珠澳大橋香港口岸撞閘，撞毀檢查亭逃走。警方透過「銳眼計劃」追蹤私家車，早上在屯門海榮路一帶設路障，追截後拘捕疑犯。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T12:42:13.573851+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":206,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T12:06:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T23:18:09.484855+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T12:38:31.937408+00:00","content_hash":"2ed9ab10cdc77fcdcd3717e1d0c854b0ca86500a4eb5e351e646381a8e1c2c50","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T12:42:13.573851+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}